    "No parameter, bypass, opacity, clip or geometry writes were performed.",
    "native_animated=true means a nonstatic native phase source is configured, not proof it is currently advancing. Goo Opacity and Stage Distort both report timeline Play Once & Clear with Finished=128; preserve their captured programs unless a deliberate control action takes ownership.",
    "Twitch exposes no Max Rotation parameter in any of these three current instances. All Twitch native scalar phase sources read static."
